# DevPaper Code Owners
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Global project maintainers
*                     @DevPaper/maintainers

# Security-critical infrastructure & workflows
/.github/workflows/   @DevPaper/security-maintainers
/.github/dependabot.yml @DevPaper/security-maintainers
/SECURITY.md          @DevPaper/security-maintainers

# Frontend UI, Astryx Theme, & Core Typesetting Engine
/src/                 @DevPaper/core-maintainers
/tests/               @DevPaper/core-maintainers
/package.json         @DevPaper/core-maintainers
/tsconfig.json        @DevPaper/core-maintainers

# Python FastAPI Backend & Renderers (SVG, PDF, ZIP)
/backend/             @DevPaper/backend-maintainers

# Documentation, AI specs, & community files
/*.md                 @DevPaper/docs-maintainers
/public/              @DevPaper/docs-maintainers
/CITATION.cff         @DevPaper/docs-maintainers
/ADOPTERS.md          @DevPaper/docs-maintainers
